  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - There you are! You found me!
  - Have you found any of those mushrooms yet? I've heard that you pigs are great
    at finding them!
  - They really help to stave off hunger, and the only other thing that matters in
    life is sleep. But these haystacks scattered throughout the forest should meet
    all your needs!
  - Speaking of mushrooms, you don't mind bringing me some of those parasols, do
    you? You'll find them in open terrain.
